flowchart LR
  index_html[入口跳转<br/>index.html] -->|跳到上次用的主题| themes[三个主题页<br/>cats / farm / night.html]
  v1[旧版开发者界面<br/>index-v1.html]
  themes -->|script 引入| clawd_js[Clawd 姿势与取景<br/>clawd.js]
  themes -->|script 引入| alert_js[提示音与标签页图标<br/>alert.js]
  clawd_js -->|img 引用 svg| assets[(第三方素材<br/>assets/clawd, assets/sounds)]
  alert_js -->|播放 mp3| assets
  themes -->|"GET /api/sessions<br/>SSE /api/stream"| handler[HTTP 路由<br/>Handler]
  v1 -->|"GET /api/sessions<br/>SSE /api/stream"| handler
  handler -->|校验 cookie| auth[密码、令牌与登录限速<br/>password / auth_token / LoginLimiter]:::changed
  handler -->|读缓存 payload| board[状态看板线程<br/>Board / describe]
  handler -->|增量读 + 解析| tail[transcript 解析<br/>Tail / parse_line]
  handler -->|transcript_of| ccstatus[会话状态判据<br/>ccstatus.py]
  board -->|"fetch_agents / group_agents"| ccstatus
  app_main[启动<br/>app.main] -->|起后台线程| board
  app_main -->|ThreadingHTTPServer| handler
  service[systemd 用户服务<br/>ccmon.service] -->|ExecStart| app_main
  demo[假数据演示<br/>demo.py] -->|子进程 + 假 HOME| app_main
  fetch_assets[素材下载脚本<br/>fetch-assets.sh] -->|curl 写入| assets

